          "content": "I think the main argument is: 'You should buy this product because a celebrity endorses it and it will make you look/feel better.'\n\nConclusion: Buy this product\nPremise 1: A famous person uses/endorses it\nPremise 2: It will improve your appearance/confidence\n\nBut the celebrity endorsement doesn't actually provide evidence that the product works — it's more of a persuasive technique than a logical premise.",
