          "content": "Excellent analysis! You're both identifying the key structure and already spotting fallacies. Let me add: one thing to watch for in marketing arguments is UNSTATED premises (assumptions). The ad might never say 'celebrity endorsement = quality,' but the argument relies on that assumption. Part of critical thinking is making those unstated premises visible so we can evaluate them.",
