      "content": "Let's dig deeper into argument structure. In Chapter 2, we learned the difference between:\n\n- An argument: premises supporting a conclusion\n- An explanation: stating why or how something happened\n- An illustration: giving an example of a general point\n- A conditional statement: if-then structure\n\nHow would you classify the celebrity endorsement in the marketing campaign? Is it serving as a premise in an argument? Or is it something else (rhetorical device, emotional appeal, etc.)?\n\nUse specific reasoning to support your answer.",
