      "title": "The ad uses a lot of unsupported assertions — claims without evidence",
      "content": "I rewatched the campaign materials and noticed something: most of the key claims are just stated as facts without any evidence.\n\n'The best product on the market' — by what measure? Who says?\n'Recommended by experts' — which experts? What are their credentials?\n'Clinically proven' — what studies? Where were they published?\n\nThis is exactly what we learned about — assertions dressed up as arguments. Real arguments have premises and evidence, not just claims.",
